{"id": "9696", "type": "page", "slug": "home-2", "path": "home-2", "title": "Home", "date": "2026-08-19 12:12:53", "modified": "2026-09-08 17:15:39", "excerpt": "", "content": "<section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-home-hero-7.jpg\"\n\t\t\t\t\t     alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSeventy years of healing, the next seventy begin now\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Awaken your body's <em>innate ability to thrive</em></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Immerse yourself in your life&#039;s most transformative journey on a 55-acre wellness retreat center. \nWhere a heart-centered community focused on wholistic longevity converse to redefine what it means to be alive.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#journeys\">Stay With Us&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#film\">Watch the film</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstablished 1956\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t55-acre Florida campus\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t21 &amp; 28-day residential programs\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGuests from 100+ countries\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<section>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWest Palm Beach, Florida\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>A pioneer in integrative wellness, <em>guided by decades of experience</em></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Hippocrates is a living environment of transformation where education, food community, nature, and personal responsibility come together to heal people from their life's most critical challenges.</p>A 21-day residential, plant-based wellness program and health retreat in West Palm Beach, Florida. People arrive carrying real emotional weight. Fear, stress, grief, addiction, illness, depression, sadness, anger.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl><dt>Release Burden</dt><dd>Address the load the body carries — the inflammation, environmental exposures, and stressors that keep chronic conditions in motion.</dd><dt>Restore Flow</dt><dd>Rebuild the systems that move, nourish, and clear — through living food nutrition, movement, rest, and restorative therapies.</dd><dt>Renew Resilience</dt><dd>Turn healthier patterns into habits you carry home, supported by education, community, and a plan built around your life.</dd></dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/about-us/our-story/\">Our philosophy&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/experts/\">Meet the experts&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-home-heritage-4.jpg\" alt=\"Guests sharing a plant-based meal beside the pool on the Hippocrates campus\"></figure></section>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1956\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFounded\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t55\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAcre Florida campus\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t21–28\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDay residential programs\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t70\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYears of practice\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrograms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>One foundation. <em>Different journeys.</em></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every stay shares the same foundation — living foods, therapies, education and rest. What changes is the path you take through it.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLiving-foods nutrition\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTherapy Center\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDaily education\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMovement &amp; rest\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCommunity\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ltp-header-opti.jpg\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t     alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t21 Days\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Life Transformation Program</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A full reset of how you eat, move, rest and think — with the education to carry it home.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href=\"/programs/resort-programs/life-transformation-program/\">Learn more&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ccwp-header-image-opti.jpg\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t     alt=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t28 Days\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Comprehensive Cancer Wellness Program</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>An extended, closely supported program for guests living with a cancer diagnosis, designed to support metabolic health and immune function alongside medical care</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href=\"/health-challenges/comprehensive-cancer-wellness-program/\">Learn more&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Not sure which journey is right for you?</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A complimentary consultation with a wellness advisor takes about twenty minutes.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjM1NDQiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D\">Book a free consultation&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Experience\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What a stay at Hippocrates feels like</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/the-campus-facilities/\">Explore the campus&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/998661074?h=eae0ee5701&#038;autoplay=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1\"\n\t        aria-label=\"Play the video\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-home-hero-8.jpg\" alt=\"The Hippocrates campus\">\n\t\t&#9654;\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Mornings</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Movement in the garden, green juice, and time in the pools before the day begins.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Kitchen</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Organic, plant-based living cuisine prepared on site, three times a day.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Therapies</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A therapy center offering bodywork, hydrotherapy and restorative treatments.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Evenings</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lectures, cooking classes and community — the education that outlasts the stay.</p>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAlumni Stories\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>In their <em>own</em> words</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Personal accounts from guests who have stayed with us. Individual experiences, not predicted outcomes.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/alumni/\">All alumni stories&#8594;</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051088353?h=195ddc6682&#038;autoplay=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1\"\n\t        aria-label=\"Play the video: Jennifer\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-jennifer-13.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t&#9654;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJennifer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLife Transformation Program alumna\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&#8220;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>I arrived exhausted and I left with a way of eating and living that I actually understood.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<footer>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJennifer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLife Transformation Program alumna\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051094995?h=a0511f65ee&#038;autoplay=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1\"\n\t        aria-label=\"Play the video: Arthur\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-arthur-13.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t&#9654;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArthur\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHippocrates alumnus, 2023\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&#8220;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A compassionate team, and a place that pays attention to the whole person, not one number.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<footer>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArthur\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHippocrates alumnus, 2023\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051094959?h=fd35aa935d&#038;autoplay=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1\"\n\t        aria-label=\"Play the video: Marrisa\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-marrisa-13.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t&#9654;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMarrisa\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHippocrates alumna, 2022\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&#8220;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>What has stayed with me is the knowledge — every meal at home is different now.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<footer>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMarrisa\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHippocrates alumna, 2022\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-hw-video=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1051095071?h=e1965cab3e&#038;autoplay=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1\"\n\t        aria-label=\"Play the video: Synia\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hw-testimonials-synia-13.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n\t\t&#9654;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSynia\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHippocrates alumni story\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t